Subject: [PATCH] spi: airoha-snfi: initialize SFC clock environment on EcoNet EN7528

勘误：下面“时钟环境缺失是读 ID 全零的根因”的推断不成立——内核期 chip_scu[0x11c] 本来就是 0x501，补写是空操作（devices/openwrt/gs2107/docs/14-NAND-READ-PATH-FIX.md §4）。按 11-08 开机日志的时间线，探测失败的直接原因是 spi-nand 核心没有 0xBC 厂商表项，029-18 补上后即识别出 BWET08U（devices/openwrt/gs2107/captures/flash-direct-20261108-074329.log:194）。本补丁的三写与原厂一致、无害，保留；SI_CK_SEL 与 MACMUX_SEL 两写是否必要未单独实测。以下为当时的原说明。

Reading the SPI NAND ID on GS2107 (EcoNet EN7528) returns all zeros
(spi-nand spi0.0: unknown raw ID 0000000000, probe failed -122), while tcboot
and the stock 3.18 kernel read the same flash fine (mfr 0xbc dev 0xb2).

Disassembly of both vendor implementations (docs/11-NAND-ROOTCAUSE.md, A-level)
shows the ID-read FIFO sequence is byte-identical to airoha_snand_exec_op(),
so the protocol is fine - the flash simply does not answer. Both vendor
implementations write three registers before touching the flash, which this
driver never does:
  - chip_scu[0x11c] = (old & 0xffff) | 0x0501   (SFC clock divider + enable,
    the net effect of the vendor spi_nor_set_clock_speed(40): 400M/2/5=40MHz)
  - SFC SI_CK_SEL  = 9
  - SFC MACMUX_SEL = 1   (written right before read_id)

The SFC FSM does run (ID read returns in ~7ms, not the 250ms FIFO poll
timeout), so the clock is present but the flash does not respond - pointing
at a missing/incorrect clock environment rather than a FIFO issue.

Gate on the EN7528 chip_scu syscon compatible so EN7523/EN7581/AN7583
boards sharing this driver are unaffected.

--- a/drivers/spi/spi-airoha-snfi.c	2026-11-08 03:21:03.615749896 +0800
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-airoha-snfi.c	2026-11-08 03:21:15.328513407 +0800
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
 #include <linux/errno.h>
 #include <linux/limits.h>
 #include <linux/math.h>
+#include <linux/mfd/syscon.h>
 #include <linux/minmax.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/mutex.h>
@@ -1062,9 +1063,10 @@
 	struct airoha_snand_ctrl *as_ctrl;
 	struct device *dev = &pdev->dev;
 	struct spi_controller *ctrl;
+	struct regmap *scu;
 	bool dma_enable = true;
 	void __iomem *base;
-	u32 sfc_strap;
+	u32 sfc_strap, val;
 	int err;
 
 	ctrl = devm_spi_alloc_host(dev, sizeof(*as_ctrl));
@@ -1099,6 +1101,30 @@
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(as_ctrl->spi_clk),
 				     "unable to get spi clk\n");
 
+	/*
+	 * [econet bring-up] SFC 时钟环境写入（GS2107）
+	 *
+	 * 这三写与原厂一致、无害，保留；它们不是当年读 ID 失败的原因：内核期 chip_scu[0x11c] 本来就是 0x501，补写是空操作（devices/openwrt/gs2107/docs/14-NAND-READ-PATH-FIX.md §4）。按 11-08 开机日志的时间线，探测失败的直接原因是 spi-nand 核心没有 0xBC 厂商表项（029-18 补上）。SI_CK_SEL/MACMUX_SEL 两写是否必要未单独实测：
+	 *   1) chip_scu[0x11c] = (old & 0xffff) | 0x0501
+	 *      = 原厂 spi_nor_set_clock_speed(40) 的净效果
+	 *      （bit0 使能 + bits[15:8]=5 → 400M/2/5 = 40MHz）
+	 *   2) SFC SI_CK_SEL  = 9（原厂 NOR probe 同值）
+	 *   3) SFC MACMUX_SEL = 1（原厂 read_id 前一步写）
+	 * 门禁：仅 EN7528 系，不影响同驱动的 EN7523/EN7581/AN7583 板。
+	 */
+	scu = syscon_regmap_lookup_by_compatible("econet,en7528-chip-scu");
+	if (!IS_ERR(scu)) {
+		if (!regmap_read(scu, 0x11c, &val)) {
+			dev_info(dev, "chip_scu[0x11c]: %08x -> %08x\n",
+				 val, (val & 0xffff) | 0x0501);
+			regmap_write(scu, 0x11c, (val & 0xffff) | 0x0501);
+		}
+		regmap_write(as_ctrl->regmap_ctrl, REG_SPI_CTRL_SI_CK_SEL, 9);
+		regmap_write(as_ctrl->regmap_ctrl, REG_SPI_CTRL_MACMUX_SEL, 1);
+	} else {
+		dev_warn(dev, "no econet chip_scu syscon, skip SFC clock setup\n");
+	}
+
 	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,en7523-snand") ||
 	    device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,en7581-snand")) {
 		err = regmap_read(as_ctrl->regmap_ctrl,
